{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And you shall sanctify the fiftieth year.</b> Through the working of the land and all who dwell on it." "<b>Deror.</b> It is known that it is like חפשי (free), like וכדרור לעוף (and like the flight of a bird). A small bird sings when it is on its own, but if it is in a person's possession it does not eat until it dies." "<b>Yovel.</b> Like שלוח (dismissal). And the Sages said that the meaning of yovel is ram, and the proof is והעברת שופר תרועה (you shall sound the shofar), and the year is called by the name of the shofar." "And the meaning of <b>it shall be to you.</b> To Israel alone." "<b>And you shall return, each man to his holding.</b> As He will explain: כי בשנת היובל תשוב הארץ הנמכרת לבעליה (for in the Jubilee year the sold land shall return to its owners)." "<b>And each man to his family.</b> The slave sold to an Israelite."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:19.986253634Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}